    <string name="accessibility_service_summary">Applies the screen time rules set from the parent app</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">BraviaGuard needs this to see which app is in front of the screen. It uses that to count screen time and to show the blocked message when a rule applies. It does not read the contents of any app, and nothing leaves your home network.</string>

